OL,3,GNEWSARecord heat leaves flower growers
OL,4,Ashort of blooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish flower growers say the hottest
OL,7,Fsummer on record has cost them entire
OL,8,Fcrops, with some unable to bring
OL,9,Fanything to London markets.
OL,11,FSpeaking at Chiswick Flower Market on
OL,12,FSunday, some growers said they had lost
OL,13,Fmost of their crops due to the weather,
OL,14,Fwhile others described the measures
OL,15,Fthey had taken to save theirs with one
OL,16,Fsaying they had lived in a caravan in
OL,17,Fthe middle of her field so they could
OL,18,Fwater the plants before and after the
OL,19,Fday's extreme heat.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
