OL,3,GNEWSARecord heat leaves flower growers
OL,4,Ashort of blooms
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of the monthly market said
OL,7,Fseveral had dropped out because they
OL,8,Fhad nothing to bring.
OL,10,FMet Office provisional figures show
OL,11,Fsummer 2026 was the UK's warmest since
OL,12,Frecords began in 1884.
